Per-app network usage	Partial, not real-time	NetworkStatsManager can expose usage history in time buckets. Access to other apps' data requires the special usage-stat access path and user action in Settings; it is not a fine-grained socket monitor.
Live network metadata	Possible through an optional VpnService design	Requires explicit system consent, clear start/stop controls, a visible active notification, and compatibility testing. Capture only what the VPN design can actually observe. Do not claim HTTPS payload inspection.
